 ## Retries
 
-A capture that times out is tried again, up to 3 attempts in all, one after the other.
+A capture that times out is tried again, up to 5 attempts in all, waiting 2, 4, 6 and 8 seconds between them. On a
+Friday in 2025 the gateway slowed during its evening peak and 58 confirmed pantry orders went uncharged, caught only
+by a volunteer capturing them by hand from the gateway's dashboard the next morning; replaying that Friday's timeouts
+against the gateway's sandbox showed 5 attempts spaced this way would have captured 57 of the 58. The gateway's
+contract runs to December 2026, so switching gateways wasn't an option. The member waits up to 20 seconds longer on
+the confirmation page when every attempt times out; accepted as better than a volunteer capturing dozens of orders by
+hand.
 
